  "description": "This bike exists to satisfy your need for speed. Designed for the messy, unpredictable, beautiful reality of riding fast, the Speedmachine 01 ONE excels whether it’s the second leg of your Ironman triathlon or a race against the clock. Born from a design collaboration between the BMC Impec Lab and Red Bull Advanced Technologies, this is the fastest triathlon bike the industry has ever produced.\nEverything is engineered around you: rider-first geometry, unmatched position flexibility, and a fully integrated system that turns your power into speed with ruthless efficiency. A SRAM Force AXS groupset with integrated power, paired with flagship DT Swiss ARC 1600 SPLINE 65mm wheels, completes a machine that’s as precise as it is aggressive. Up front, Profile Design’s Aeria 3 armrests and extensions lock in your position so you can stay fast for longer.\nNow it’s time to find out what a difference expert frame engineering can make.",
